      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "WHY NOT OLIVIA (1) flew the lids with a sensational early split and hit the frame with a 1.75 lengths second (20.01) over 350m at Traralgon. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings four times from seven attempts. Leading chance again. GALLOPING HAPPY (2) ran below best last time finishing fourth (24.30) over 425m at Traralgon from Box 8. Boasts two wins from three starts out of this box. A forward showing wouldn't surprise. DEADLY FORCE (8) is progressing well with another good run last time, placing (19.24) from Box 4 at Healesville. Didn't win last time but still ran one of the quickest times on the card. Expected to feature. PLAY LAB (3) profiles nicely over this trip.",
